Process-metric self-test case: preflight-d-no-timestamp

Kind: preflight (score/preflight.ts), arm D, task T1

Scenario
D run whose assistant events carry no timestamp; the payments rule was loaded by a Read before the first src edit.

Expected
The first src edit has no parseable time, so ordering cannot be checked: d_delivered is null with D_DELIVERY_UNVERIFIABLE, never a vacuous pass (review: stats-preflight finding 2).

@RUN@ in stream.jsonl and instr.jsonl stands for the recorded run root; ../process.ts substitutes it.
